Package: impact
Type: Package
Title: Inclusive Multimorbidity Phenotyping Algorithm and Coding Tool
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan A.", "Batty", email = "J.Batty@leeds.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Ascertain long-term conditions from routinely collected, coded
    healthcare data (ICD-9-CM, ICD-9-PCS, ICD-10-CM, ICD-10-PCS, ICD-10,
    OPCS-4, primary-care terminology and SNOMED CT values) using IMPACT,
    the Inclusive Multimorbidity Phenotyping Algorithm and Coding Tool.
